<title>USA: Big Rivers cuts 81 jobs at generating plants.</title>
<headline>Big Rivers cuts 81 jobs at generating plants.</headline>
<dateline>HENDERSON, Ky. 1996-09-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Big Rivers Corp and PacifiCorp said Friday 81 jobs were eliminated at Big Rivers' generating plants and headquarters facilities.</p>
<p>The companies cited the action is an effort to keep rates stable for its customers and to be competitive in selling wholesale power.</p>
<p>Big Rivers and PacifiCorp are completing details of a transaction in which PacifiCorp will operate Big Rivers' generation facilities during the next 25 years, while selling power to Big Rivers and marketing the surplus.</p>
<p>Big Rivers is a generation and transmission cooperative that serves western Kentucky, while PacifiCorp serves seven western states and Australia.</p>
</text>
